sia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***Iran Washington and Tehran are stuck in a loo', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/handshakes-without-headway/'}, {'signal_id': 'b68c0f46276c3380', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Ground Beneath the Cloud: Dispersion and Dependency in the Digital Age <p>Commercial cloud architecture has made digital infrastructure more resilient to localized disruption. Geographic dispersion, workload migration, and failover have allowed providers to preserve access in', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-ground-beneath-the-cloud-dispersion-and-dependency-in-the-digital-age/'}, {'signal_id': '4c0d12875ff753db', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Is Dollar Dominance in Decline? <p>The dominance of the U.S. dollar is a crucial source of American global power. The dollar&#8217;s widespread use, strength, and reliability provide major economic advantages for the United States, enable U.S. sanctions to have real bite, and sig', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/is-dollar-dominance-in-decline/'}, {'signal_id': '84e8b17df6930030', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Atlantic Brief: After the U.S. Midterms, Trans-Atlantic Defense Cooperation <p>For this edition of The Atlantic Brief, the Royal United Services Institute and War on the Rocks present a dialogue on the future of trans-Atlantic defense cooperation following the U.S. midterm el', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-atlantic-brief-after-the-u-s-midterms-trans-atlantic-defense-cooperation/'}, {'signal_id': 'b0c7bb436c865d9d', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The U.S.-Chinese-Russian Summit and the Future of Trilateral Nuclear Talks <p>U.S. President Donald Trump, who has sought nuclear arms control with Russia and China since his first term, may finally have his chance. The first-ever U.S.-Chinese-Russian leaders&#8217; summit is set', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-u-s-chinese-russian-summit-and-the-future-of-trilateral-nuclear-talks/'}, {'signal_id': '00fd316ec36d3e98', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Keeping America Out: Revisiting China’s Deterrence Strategy for Taiwan <p>In 2025, Joel Wuthnow wrote &#8220;How China Could Counter U.S. Intervention in War Over Taiwan,&#8221; arguing that Beijing&#8217;s best option might be to deter Washington from coming to Taiwan&#8217;s ai', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/keeping-america-out-revisiting-chinas-deterrence-strategy-for-taiwan/'}, {'signal_id': 'b255e84550957510', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Spending Isn’t Deterrence: Fixing Germany’s Procurement Machine <p>In 2026, Germany is spending a record &#8364;125 billion on defense, second only to the United States among NATO allies, and its core defense budget is set to reach &#8364;170 billion by 2029. Its military strateg', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/spending-isnt-deterrence-fixing-germanys-procurement-machine/'}, {'signal_id': 'fd45d2f99a1ca7a8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Military Strategic Drivers Behind China’s Nuclear Expansion <p>In June 1993, a group of Second Artillery Corps senior leaders gathered at the Jiuquan Satellite Launch Center. The organizers brought Li Xuge, recently retired commander of the Second Artillery, as a special gues', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-military-strategic-drivers-behind-chinas-nuclear-expansion/'}, {'signal_id': '376c7a24e6749a74', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Theater in Abu Dhabi, Everyday Life at Home: Why the War Still Shapes Every Story <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selec', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/theater-in-abu-dhabi-everyday-life-at-home-why-the-war-still-shapes-every-story/'}, {'signal_id': '6f429e69d4c0dd90', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_sn