cks.com/winning-time-ukraines-unmanned-systems-forces-and-the-new-dimension-of-war/'}, {'signal_id': '35307a8b309661e3', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Stained Glass and Sacred Spaces: Symbolism Abounds in Ukrainian Media <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of arti', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/stained-glass-and-sacred-spaces-symbolism-abounds-in-ukrainian-media/'}, {'signal_id': '54e1acb6eed09ca1', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Record Budgets and Missing Suppliers Shaping America’s Munitions Ramp <p>The Pentagon is sending a record demand signal for munitions, but turning it into deliveries depends on suppliers several tiers below the primes, many of which disappeared over the last two decades. Marc', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-record-budgets-and-missing-suppliers-shaping-americas-munitions-ramp/'}, {'signal_id': '809779cf72ee5105', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Rethinking Strategic Stability with China: From Coercion to Constructivism <p>Every administration since the Cold War has been looking for a significant foreign policy breakthrough with China. Spanning containment and normalization to opening and reform, U.S. policymakers have lo', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/rethinking-strategic-stability-with-china-from-coercion-to-constructivism/'}, {'signal_id': 'ea5c5e67c7570db3', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Talks, Attacks, and a Heist <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranNow that the U.S. midterms are over, the', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/talks-attacks-and-a-heist/'}, {'signal_id': '68b68ddd90e8e362', 'source': 'war_on