inking Too Small About Ukraine’s Victory <p>Since fall 2023, Ukraine&#8217;s supporters have fallen into a pattern: Ukrainians warn that Russia is targeting its energy infrastructure to prevent them from heating their homes, schools, and businesses in the coming win', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-west-is-thinking-too-small-about-ukraines-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '504789077c3e2db9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fighting in Ethiopia and the Risk of Regional Spillover <p>In September, fighting broke out in Ethiopia&#8217;s Tigray region between Ethiopian government forces and the Tigray People&#8217;s Liberation Front (TPLF), effectively collapsing the 2022 peace deal. In October, Ethiopi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fighting-in-ethiopia-and-the-risk-of-regional-spillover/'}, {'signal_id': '96067be01a3925c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Establishing Battery Supply Chain Resilience for Drones <p>Militaries have spent more than a century operating with fuel and ammunition as limits of combat endurance. They are only beginning to treat batteries with the same operational seriousness, as small unmanned systems move ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/establishing-battery-supply-chain-resilience-for-drones/'}, {'signal_id': '46c8ac1798543095', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tehran is a Different Beast Now <p>The Tehran that the world knew is gone. It died in the fires with former Supreme Leader Ali Khamenei on the first day of the war in February. His son and new Supreme Leader, Mojtaba Khamenei &#8212; wherever he is and in whatever physical condit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/tehran-is-a-different-beast-now/'}, {'signal_id': '20959e0f322e0b35', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Reading Pyongyang Through the Cracks of the International System <p>In 2023, three North Korea analysts identified what they believe most people studying the country get wrong, and how analysts ca