kely to ever consider running for president. Rob Sand doubts he'd ever consider running for president", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/19/rob-sand-iowa-2028-01177322'}, {'signal_id': 'a079cb01416e04bc', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Massachusetts gov says Dems want ‘a uniter and a fighter’ for 2028 Democrat Maura Healey just won her second term as governor. 'You can be a uniter and a fighter': Gov. Maura Healey details hopes for 2028 Dem nominee", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/19/massachusetts-gov-maura-healey-2028-01177150'}, {'signal_id': '87ee0ae84dd3790a', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Keisha Lance Bottoms says Democrats better spend big on the South Georgia's new governor says Democrats shouldn't have to ‘beg and borrow’ to get resources for campaigns in the South. “I would hope that in two years, we're not having to beg and borrow to be able to run successful", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/19/keisha-lance-bottoms-democrats-campaigns-south-01177147'}, {'signal_id': '0925b9ccd0f8cfc6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Beshear defends Texas strategy The chair of the Democratic Governors Association has taken fire for not spending enough on Gov.-elect Gina Hinojosa’s race in Texas <p>Kentucky Gov. Andy Beshear defended his decision not to invest more in Gina Hinojosa’s successful race for Texas ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/19/beshear-texas-strategy-hinojosa-01176684'}, {'signal_id': 'a012035b78ffbbeb', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Leader of Democratic AG group to step down after Texas triumph Sean Rankin led DAGA for a decade, helping Democrats flip five GOP-held attorney general offices. <p>CHICAGO — The head of the Democratic Attorneys General Association is stepping down after a successful 2026 cycle in', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/19/after-texas-triumph-daga-chief-steps-aside-01176340'}, {'signal_id': 'f7ead8905f082421', 'source': 'politico'