k stops with [Trump]” when pressed on whether the White House plays a role in the appearance of corruption and self-dealing. <p>Outgoing Sen. John Cornyn sees th', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/17/cornyn-trump-nvidia-corruption-perceptions-01170190'}, {'signal_id': '72de1ca7ac6005d5', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Inside the Trump administration’s divisions over China <h3 class="title">Inside the Trump administration’s divisions over China</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/28ac5856-c2a5-4cab-b608-3fc606c1ce6c/f7373108-50f8-4c21-9d89-c3107f', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/17/inside-the-trump-administrations-divisions-over-china-2231033'}, {'signal_id': '1c368a189f883845', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Democrats see an immigration opening despite Stephen Miller’s rise Several moderate Democrats have already placed calls to the White House and Trump administration officials to express a willingness to work together. <p>In the days before the midterm election, Rep. Henry Cuellar ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/17/democrats-trump-immigration-reform-01168941'}, {'signal_id': 'c02dc7d17d615f34', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Schumer’s challenger <h3 class="title">Schumer’s challenger</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/6e87a0dd-4c89-410b-9a6f-149deb6e66dd/e082fb97-4d5f-4d3a-84ee-2ff187643dad/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/16/schumers-challenger-2230544'}, {'signal_id': '96efa2d71b87697d', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Poll: Republicans have a MAGA dilemma after their midterm losses For a party that has spent the last decade united around a singular figure, new results from The POLITICO Poll reveal tension over where it should go next. <p>The Republican Party’s midterm wipeout has torn apart Pr', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/